n icon and tags if you need to group devices by model, location, environment or another operational criterion."},"1128":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#verify-the-registration","content":"The device should appear with status **No Identity** until it completes enrollment or receives a manually assigned identity."},"1129":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"The **Assign Identity** action is available while the device remains in **No Identity**."},"1130":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Open the device and select **Assign Identity**."},"1131":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Choose an active certificate whose `Common Name` matches the `Device ID`."},"1132":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"If none exists, select **Issue New Instead** and choose a CA linked to the DMS."},"1133":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Confirm the assignment."},"1134":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"The device should change to **Active** and the certificate should appear in its history."},"1135":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#revoke-the-current-identity","content":"In **Device Event Timeline**, locate the latest active certificate and select **Revoke**. Choose a reason consistent with your policy and confirm the operation."},"1136":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#revoke-the-current-identity","content":"Revocation invalidates the certificate but does not delete the device. You can restore its operation by assigning it a new identity. `CertificateHold` allows reactivating the retained certificate; all other reasons are final."},"1137":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#decommission-a-device","content":"This action revokes all the device's certificates and prevents it from obtaining an identity again."},"1138":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#decommission-a-device","content":"Use **Decommission** only when the device has stopped operating or is no longer trustworthy. After confirming, Lamassu revokes the active identity with `CessationOfOperation` and changes the status to **Decommissioned**."},"1139":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#automate-enrollment","content":"<Card title=\"Configure a DMS\" description=\"Define the CA, trust and policies of the fleet.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#automate-enrollment","content":"<Card title=\"Integrate EST\" description=\"Let the device request and renew its identity.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment\" />"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment","type":"page","content":"Device enrollment with EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Operate Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment","content":"EST protocol guide for Lamassu IoT, with DMS configuration for the PKI administrator and the endpoint reference for device integrators."},"1143":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/est-enrollment#est-enrollment-over-secure-transport","content":"EST: Enrollment over 