quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Choose RSA or ECDSA, define the validity and select the key usages. For a device identity that uses mTLS, enable **Digital Signature** and **Client Authentication**."},"1802":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"The validity cannot exceed the expiration date of the issuing CA."},"1803":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#issue-and-download","content":"Confirm the issuance and immediately download the certificate and the private key in PEM format."},"1804":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-result","content":"The certificate should appear in **Issued Certificates** with an active status. Check its subject, SANs, issuer, usages and validity period."},"1805":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#next-step","content":"Register your first device to associate the identity with a managed entity, or see certificate management."},"1806":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Get started","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Get a first result with Lamassu and continue from a working base."},"1808":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#recommended-path","content":"Recommended path"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"The quickstarts take you from a prepared instance to an active device identity. Each guide produces a verifiable result and links the detailed explanation when you need to go deeper."},"1811":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#recommended-path","content":"<Card title=\"1. Create your first CA\" description=\"Establish a root of trust capable of issuing certificates.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority\" />"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/