/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"Automate the next device"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"In this quickstart you will manually register a device and assign it its first certificate. It is the shortest path to understanding how Lamassu relates a physical entity to its identity history."},"1825":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"A configured DMS."},"1826":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"A CA associated with the DMS."},"1827":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"A unique identifier for the device."},"1828":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"Open **Managed Devices**, select the action to register a device and complete:"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Device ID**: unique identifier of the device."},"1830":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Registration Authority**: the DMS that will apply the enrollment policies."},"1831":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Icon** and **Tags**: optional classification to locate it later."},"1832":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Open the newly created device. It should appear with status **No Identity**: it exists in the inventory but does not yet have an associated certificate."},"1833":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Select **Assign Identity**. Lamassu will search for active certificates whose `Common Name` matches the `Device ID`."},"1834":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Select an existing certificate or use **Issue New Instead** to issue one from a CA linked to the DMS."},"1835":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verify-the-device","content":"After confirming, the status should change to **Active**. Review **Certificate History** to check the associated identity and **Device Event Timeline** to see the assignment event."},"1836":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"Manual registration helps you understand the model, but a fleet should use automated enrollment. Continue with Device Management Service and the EST integration."},"1837":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Administer Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose access, health, issuance, enrollment and dependencies in a Lamassu deployment."},"1839":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#diagnostic-sequence","content":"Diagnostic sequence"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-a-single-operation","content":"Reproduce a single operation"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Separate client, Gateway and service"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Review Kubernetes status"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Query the affected service"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#validate-the-result-from-outside","content":"Validate the result from outside"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Minimal evidence collection"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"I cannot sign in"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Everything returns 403 or 5xx"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"A pod is not Ready"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Issuance fails"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#est-enrollment-fails","content":"EST enrollment fails"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"OCSP or CRL do not reflect a change"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"Events are not arriving"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Observability"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Start by locating the failing layer. A Gateway response, an unready pod and a rejected issuance can look like the same problem from the console, but they require different evidence."},"1855":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-a-single-operation","content":"Note the time in UTC, user or principal, resource, endpoint and result. Avoid repeating a destructive action such as revocation or deletion."},"1856":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Check the HTTP status. A 401 points to authentication; a 403, to authorization; a 404, to route or resource; a 5xx, to the service or a dependency."},"1857":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Locate unready pods, restarts, recent events and the state of the release."},"1858":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Review its /health endpoint and its logs in the same time window. Then follow the indicated dependency: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, the OIDC provider or the cryptographic engine."},"1859":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting