gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defínelo únicamente cuando:"},"312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"tu balanceador cloud o bare metal permite solicitar una dirección concreta"},"313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"esa dirección está asignada a este Gateway"},"314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"la red ya enruta el tráfico de esa dirección hasta el clúster"},"315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Esto solicita `192.168.1.50`; no reclama la IP en tu LAN ni la vuelve accesible."},"316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"No confundas estos valores:"},"317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`gateway.addresses` solicita una dirección para el Gateway."},"318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.addresses` añade direcciones IP a los SAN del certificado TLS."},"319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Si los usuarios se conectan por DNS, añade el nombre a `tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.hostnames`. No copies la IP pública de un proxy upstream en `gateway.addresses`."},"320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Para una VM pequeña con K3s o MicroK8s, usa un único Gateway externo de Lamassu y enruta todos los endpoints a través de él:"},"321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Este diseño utiliza una IP, un punto de entrada TLS y un único par de puertos. El chart ya crea las rutas necesarias."},"322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s ServiceLB implementa cada Service `LoadBalancer` mediante pods que reservan los puertos del Service en el nodo. En un único nodo, solo un Service puede ocupar el puerto 80 y otro el 443. El Service Traefik que K3s instala por defecto puede estar ocupando ambos."},"323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Para el diseño recomendado:"},"324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu expuesto externamente."},"325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Comprueba que los puertos 80 y 443 están libres. Deshabilita o reconfigura Traefik si no forma parte de la ruta de tráfico."},"326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Permite esos puertos en el firewall de la VM y en cualquier security group upstream."},"327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Apunta DNS a la dirección accesible de la VM."},"328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Consulta la documentación de K3s ServiceLB para conocer el uso de host ports y cómo sustituirlo por otro balanceador."},"329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Asigna una VIP de un pool accesible desde la LAN. Puedes solicitarla con `gateway.addresses` si la implementación lo permite. Confirma la dirección asignada en el estado en lugar de asumir que la solicitud tuvo éxito."},"330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Una dirección pública externa puede reenviar TCP 80 y 443 a la VM o a una VIP de Kubernetes:"},"331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"La IP pública pertenece al dispositivo externo. Deja `gateway.addresses` sin definir o usa la dirección real del lado de Kubernetes, nunca una IP que el clúster no pueda asociar."},"332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Primero decide si necesitas tres data planes independientes o solo tres nombres de host."},"333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Requisito"},"334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño recomendado"},"335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Consecuencia"},"336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"te