docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","content":"La jerarquía determina el alcance de cualquier error o compromiso. Una raíz firma CAs intermedias; las intermedias emiten las identidades que usan dispositivos y servicios. Esta separación permite aislar entornos y rotar una rama sin reemplazar toda la confianza."},"684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Para una instalación de producción, utiliza una raíz muy restringida y una o más intermedias operativas. Separa intermedias cuando cambie alguno de estos límites:"},"685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"entorno, como producción y preproducción;"},"686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"propietario o equipo operador;"},"687":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"familia de dispositivos o proceso de fabricación;"},"688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"región o requisito regulatorio;"},"689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"motor criptográfico o política de clave;"},"690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"ventana de mantenimiento y ritmo de renovación."},"691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Evita jerarquías profundas sin una necesidad concreta. Cada nivel añade distribución de cadena, validación y otro certificado que debes renovar."},"692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Una CA hija y los certificados finales deben expirar antes que su emisor. Reserva un margen que permita distribuir otra cadena y renovar los certificados dependientes."},"693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Reemitir una CA** crea un certificado nuevo sobre la clave existente. Lamassu genera una CSR con esa clave, autofirma si es una raíz o pide a la CA padre que firme si es subordinada. El nuevo certificado queda activo y la CA apunta a su número de serie; los certificados anterior y nuevo quedan enlazados mediante metadatos."},"694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Rotar una CA** crea una clave y una autoridad sucesoras. Es la opción adecuada ante compromiso, cambio criptográfico, migración de motor o política de claves no exportables."},"695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"Lamassu no permite reemitir una CA ya revocada ni una CA cuya fecha de expiración haya pasado. Anticípate a ambas condiciones."},"696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Reemite si la clave sigue siendo confiable y solo necesitas otro periodo de validez o un certificado actualizado."},"697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Rota la clave si existe sospecha de compromiso, cambia el algoritmo o quieres mover la custodia a otro motor."},"698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Crea una rama paralela si no puedes actualizar todos los consumidores al mismo tiempo."},"699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Revoca inmediatamente solo cuando el riesgo de mantener la CA supera el impacto de interrumpir la flota."},"700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#inventaría-las-dependencias","content":"Localiza CAs hijas, certificados emitidos, DMS, conectores y almacenes de confianza externos. Incluye dispositivos que pueden permanecer desconectados durante semanas o meses."},"701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#crea-la-ca-sucesora","content":"Genera una clave nueva en el motor previsto, crea la CA y asígnale un perfil explícito. No reutilices el identificador operativo para ocultar que es una generación distinta."},"702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#distribuye-la-nueva-confianza","content":"Añade la nueva raíz o cadena a los consumidores antes de emitir con ella. En un DMS, utiliza las CAs gestionadas de `/cacerts` para mantener temporalmente las cadenas antigua y nueva."},"703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cambia-la-emisión","content":"Actualiza la CA de enrolamiento y el perfil de los DMS. Mantén las CAs de validación adicionales si todavía deben aceptarse certificados antiguos durante el re-enrolamiento."},"704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#renueva-por-lotes","content":"Migra una cohorte pequeña, valida mTLS, OCSP y CRL desde el consumidor y amplía progresivamente. Supervisa qué dispositivos siguen presentando la cadena antigua."},"705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cierra-el-solapamiento","content":"Cuando ningún consumidor legítimo dependa de la autoridad anterior, retírala de la emisión y de las CAs distribuidas. Revócala si la política lo exige."},"706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Al revocar una CA, Lamassu actualiza también sus CAs hijas y certificados emitidos a `REVOKED` con razón `CessationOfOperation`. Las revocaciones de las hijas propagan el efecto a sus propias ramas."},"707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Esto protege la coherencia de la jerarquía, pero convierte la revocación en una acción de gran impacto. No la utilices como mecanismo ordinario para dejar de emitir: primero completa la migración y elimina la CA de los flujos operativos."},"708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"La cadena nueva termina en un ancla instalada por el consumidor."},"709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Los certificados nuevos contienen AKI, SKI, KU, EKU y SAN esperados."},"710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El DMS entrega la cadena correcta mediante EST `/cacerts`."},"711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El re-enrolamiento acepta la identidad antigua durante el periodo previsto."},"712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"OCSP y CRL responden para las autoridades que siguen activas."},"713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"No quedan DMS emitiendo accidentalmente desde la CA anterior."},"714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Consulta el Modelo de confianza para entender los conjuntos de CAs del DMS y Ciclo de vida de un certificado para los estados y efectos de revocación."},"715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"page","content":"Autoridades de certificación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities"},"716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI."},"717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"Elige un flujo"},"718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-una-autoridad-nueva","content":"Crea una autoridad nueva"},"719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistente","content":"Abre el asistente"},"721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Configura la clave"},"722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-el-tipo-de-ca","content":"Elige el tipo de CA"},"723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"Define la identidad"},"724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Configura validez y usos"},"725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Crea y verifica"},"726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Utiliza una clave del KMS"},"727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#importa-una-ca-externa","content":"Importa una CA externa"},"728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#selecciona-el-motor","content":"Selecciona el motor"},"729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Carga el material"},"730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Define la emisión predeterminada"},"731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Verifica la importación"},"732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Inspecciona una autoridad"},"733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Emite certificados"},"734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revoca una CA"},"735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Evalúa el impacto"},"736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Inicia la revocación"},"737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Confirma la identidad"},"738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"Comprueba la publicación"},"739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Una autoridad de certificación (CA) vincula identidades con claves públicas mediante certificados firmados. En Lamassu puedes crear una jerarquía nueva, utilizar una clave que ya está en el KMS o incorporar una CA externa."},"740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Para diseñar una cadena completa o sustituir una autoridad en producción, consulta Jerarquía y rotación de CAs. Si necesitas estandarizar qué puede firmar cada autoridad, utiliza Perfiles de certificado."},"741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA y nueva clave:** crea una raíz de confianza desde cero. Lamassu genera y custodia el par de claves."},"742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA desde KMS:** reutiliza una clave que ya está registrada en la plataforma."},"743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar CA con clave privada:** incorpora una autoridad externa con la que Lamassu podrá emitir."},"744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar solo el certificado:** añade una autoridad para construir cadenas y validar, pero no para emitir."},"745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"¿Es tu primera vez? Sigue Crea tu primera CA para completar el recorrido mínimo."},"746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Decide si la CA será raíz o intermedia."},"747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave."},"748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Define una validez superior a la de los certificados que emitirá."},"749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Para una CA intermedia, asegúrate de que la CA padre esté activa."},"750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistente","content":"En **Certification Authorities**, selecciona **Create New CA** y elige generar un par de claves nuevo."},"751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Selecciona el motor criptográfico, el algoritmo y el tamaño o curva. Lamassu admite claves RSA y EC según las capacidades del motor."},"752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Para RSA puedes elegir 1024, 2048, 3072 o 4096 bits. Para EC están disponibles las curvas P-256, P-384 y P-521."},"753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-el-tipo-de-ca","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** para una autoridad autofirmada o **Intermediate CA** para una autoridad firmada por otra CA. En el segundo caso, elige la CA emisora."},"754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"Introduce un **CA Name** único. Este nombre se convierte en el `Common Name` del certificado. Completa los campos del Distinguished Name que necesite tu política:"},"755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`C`: código de país ISO 3166-1 de dos letras."},"756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`ST`: estado o provincia."},"757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`L`: localidad."},"758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`O`: organización."},"759":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`OU`: unidad organizativa."},"760":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"El identificador interno de la CA se genera automáticamente y no se puede modificar."},"761":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Define **CA Certificate Expiration** y **Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**. Puedes expresar una duración (`5y 8w 4d`), seleccionar una fecha o utilizar la fecha máxima permitida."},"762":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Selecciona un perfil de emisión existente o configura los `Key Usage` y `Extended Key Usage` en el formulario. Si no eliges un perfil, Lamassu aplica los usos básicos predeterminados."},"763":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Confirma el formulario. La CA debe aparecer en el inventario con su certificado PEM, estado, fecha de expiración y relación de certificados emitidos."},"764":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Una CA no puede emitir certificados que superen su propia fecha de expiración. Deja margen suficiente para renovar o sustituir la autoridad sin interrumpir a los consumidores."},"765":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Selecciona &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** cuando la clave ya esté registrada en Lamassu. El asistente pide primero la clave de soporte y después muestra la misma configuración de tipo, identidad, validez y perfil."},"766":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Este flujo resulta útil cuando la clave se creó previamente en un HSM, se importó mediante BYOK o debe reutilizarse con una política de custodia concreta."},"767":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#importa-una-ca-externa","content":"La importación conserva una autoridad creada fuera de Lamassu."},"768":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#selecciona-el-motor","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave importada."},"769":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Proporciona el certificado de CA y la clave privada en formato PEM. Para una CA subordinada, añade opcionalmente la cadena de validación."},"770":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Configura la validez que recibirán los certificados finales cuando una solicitud no indique otra duración."},"771":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Lamassu comprueba que el certificado pertenece a una CA y que el material es coherente antes de registrarlo."},"772":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Si no dispones de la clave privada, importa únicamente el certificado. La autoridad podrá formar parte de cadenas de confianza y procesos de validación, pero no podrá emitir certificados desde Lamassu."},"773":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Abre una CA desde el inventario para consultar:"},"774":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Estado y periodo de validez."},"775":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificado y cadena en formato PEM."},"776":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Número de certificados activos, expirados y revocados."},"777":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificados emitidos en **Issued Certificates**."},"778":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"CRL vinculada a la autoridad."},"779":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Metadatos y motor criptográfico asociado."},"780":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Puedes filtrar el inventario por nombre, estado y tipo de CA."},"781":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Puedes iniciar una emisión desde **Issued Certificates**, desde la acción de una CA o desde el inventario global de certificados."},"782":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Generate Key & CSR in Browser** resulta útil para una operación manual o una prueba rápida. El navegador genera la clave y debes descargarla al finalizar."},"783":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Upload Existing CSR** es la opción adecuada cuando la clave debe permanecer en el sistema de destino. Lamassu recibe la solicitud, pero nunca la clave privada."},"784":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Sigue Emite tu primer certificado para el flujo guiado. La gestión de certificados explica el inventario, la inspección y la revocación."},"785":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revocar una CA invalida la confianza en los certificados que ha emitido y puede interrumpir dispositivos y servicios. La acción es irreversible."},"786":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Identifica los certificados, dispositivos y consumidores que dependen de la CA. Prepara una autoridad y una cadena de sustitución cuando sea necesario."},"787":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Abre la autoridad y selecciona **Revoke CA**. Elige la razón que describa el incidente, por ejemplo `KeyCompromise`, `CACompromise`, `Superseded` o `CessationOfOperation`."},"788":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Escribe exactamente el nombre de la CA para habilitar **Confirm Revocation**."},"789":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"El estado debe cambiar a **REVOKED** y la CRL debe reflejar la nueva información. La CA deja de poder emitir certificados."},"790":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"La eliminación permanente solo está disponible después de revocar. Elimina el registro únicamente cuando la política de retención y auditoría lo permita."},"791":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"page","content":"Perfiles de certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles"},"792":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","content":"Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas."},"793":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#qué-controla-un-perfil","content":"Qué controla un perfil"},"794":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"Validez"},"795":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#certificado-de-ca-o-certificado-final","content":"Certificado de CA o certificado final"},"796":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"Key Usage y Extended Key Usage"},"797":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#sujeto","content":"Sujeto"},"798":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Extensiones de la CSR"},"799":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"Restricciones criptográficas"},"800":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Precedencia del perfil"},"801":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#crea-un-perfil","content":"Crea un perfil"},"802":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#define-un-único-propósito","content":"Define un único propósito"},"803":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#elige-la-validez","content":"Elige la validez"},"804":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#fija-usos-y-sujeto","content":"Fija usos y sujeto"},"805":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restringe-las-claves","content":"Restringe las claves"},"806":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#asócialo-y-prueba","content":"Asócialo y prueba"},"807":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"Ejemplos de diseño"},"808":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Cambios y eliminación"},"809":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","content":"Un perfil de emisión convierte una política de certificados en configuración reutilizable. En lugar de decidir validez, sujeto, extensiones y algoritmos en cada solicitud, defines una vez qué está permitido y asocias el perfil a una CA, un DMS o una emisión concreta."},"810":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"Puedes expresar la vigencia como una duración desde el momento de emisión o como una fecha final fija. Una duración funciona bien para identidades recurrentes; una fecha común sirve para hacer que todo un lote termine antes de una migración o retirada."},"811":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"La fecha final nunca debe superar la de la CA emisora."},"812":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#certificado-de-ca-o-certificado-final","content":"`Sign as CA` establece `IsCA` y las restricciones básicas necesarias para una autoridad. Actívalo solo en perfiles destinados a crear o reemitir CAs subordinadas."},"813":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"El perfil puede imponer usos como `DigitalSignature`, `KeyEncipherment`, `CertSign`, `CRLSign`, `ClientAuth`, `ServerAuth` u `OCSPSigning`."},"814":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"Si activas **Honor Key Usage** o **Honor Extended Key Usages**, Lamassu conserva los valores solicitados por la CSR. Si los desactivas, los sustituye por los definidos en el perfil."},"815":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"No habilites las opciones `Honor…` para solicitudes no confiables salvo que otro componente valide esos campos. De lo contrario, el solicitante puede elegir capacidades más amplias de las previstas."},"816":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#sujeto","content":"Con **Honor Subject**, el certificado conserva el sujeto de la CSR. Sin esa opción, Lamassu aplica `CN`, `O`, `OU`, `C`, `ST` y `L` del perfil. Si el perfil no define `Common Name`, se conserva el CN solicitado."},"817":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Con **Honor Extensions**, Lamassu filtra las extensiones adicionales solicitadas y conserva únicamente SAN. Sin esa opción, descarta las extensiones adicionales de la CSR."},"818":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Este comportamiento permite aceptar DNS, IP, correo o URI como identidades alternativas sin aceptar extensiones arbitrarias."},"819":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"La aplicación criptográfica puede:"},"820":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"permitir o bloquear claves RSA;"},"821":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"limitar los tamaños RSA admitidos;"},"822":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"permitir o bloquear claves ECDSA;"},"823":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"limitar los tamaños o curvas ECDSA admitidos."},"824":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"Cuando está habilitada, Lamassu comprueba la clave pública antes de crear una CA o firmar una CSR. Una clave cuyo tipo o tamaño no figure en el perfil se rechaza."},"825":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"En operaciones que admiten varias fuentes, Lamassu resuelve el perfil en este orden:"},"826":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Perfil enviado dentro de la operación."},"827":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Identificador de perfil enviado en la operación."},"828":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Perfil predeterminado asociado a la CA."},"829":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Un DMS también puede referenciar su propio perfil de emisión. De este modo, varias flotas pueden usar la misma CA con políticas distintas."},"830":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#define-un-único-propósito","content":"Separa, por ejemplo, dispositivos mTLS, servidores y CAs intermedias. Un perfil pequeño y específico es más fácil de revisar que uno que permita todos los usos."},"831":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#elige-la-validez","content":"Alinea la duración con la capacidad real de renovación de la flota. Deja margen respecto a la expiración de la CA."},"832":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#fija-usos-y-sujeto","content":"Para un dispositivo que se autentica como cliente, el punto de partida habitual es `DigitalSignature` y `ClientAuth`. Añade `ServerAuth` o `KeyEncipherment` solo si el protocolo lo necesita."},"833":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restringe-las-claves","content":"Habilita la aplicación criptográfica y enumera únicamente algoritmos y tamaños compatibles con tu política y tus dispositivos."},"834":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#asócialo-y-prueba","content":"Asocia el perfil a una CA o DMS. Emite un certificado de prueba y comprueba sujeto, SAN, KU, EKU, restricciones básicas y fechas con una herramienta X.509 independiente."},"835":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**Dispositivo mTLS**\\\nCertificado final, validez corta, `DigitalSignature`, `ClientAuth`, sujeto controlado por el DMS y SAN permitido cuando identifica al dispositivo."},"836":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**Servidor TLS**\\\nCertificado final, `DigitalSignature`, `ServerAuth` y SAN obligatorio con los nombres que utilizarán los clientes."},"837":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**CA intermedia**\\\n`Sign as CA`, `CertSign` y `CRLSign`, validez superior a sus certificados finales y restricciones criptográficas más exigentes."},"838":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"Son patrones de partida, no una política universal. Verifica siempre los requisitos del protocolo, del consumidor y del marco regulatorio aplicable."},"839":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Actualizar un perfil afecta a emisiones futuras; no modifica certificados ya firmados. Prueba los cambios antes de aplicarlos a una CA en producción y conserva la justificación operativa."},"840":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Antes de eliminar un perfil, comprueba que ninguna CA o DMS dependa de él. Si deseas sustituirlo, crea la versión nueva, actualiza las referencias y realiza una emisión de prueba antes de retirar el anterior."},"841":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"page","content":"Validación de certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation"},"842":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"Publica el estado de las identidades mediante OCSP y CRL."},"843":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Elige un mecanismo"},"844":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"La emisión demuestra quién firmó un certificado; la validación permite saber si todavía debe aceptarse. Lamassu publica el estado mediante dos mecanismos complementarios."},"845":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa **OCSP** cuando el consumidor esté conectado y necesite consultar el estado más reciente de un certificado concreto."},"846":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa una **CRL** cuando la validación deba realizarse localmente, sin conexión o sobre un volumen elevado de certificados. El consumidor descarga periódicamente una lista firmada y la conserva hasta la siguiente actualización."},"847":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Muchos entornos utilizan ambos: OCSP como comprobación primaria y CRL como mecanismo local o de respaldo."},"848":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Validación online con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta estados Good, Revoked y Unknown en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"849":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Listas de revocación\" description=\"Genera, publica y distribuye CRLs por autoridad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"850":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"page","content":"Certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates"},"851":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","content":"Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu."},"852":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Busca un certificado"},"853":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"Descarga el certificado"},"854":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca un certificado"},"855":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"Abre la acción"},"856":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Elige una razón"},"857":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma y verifica"},"858":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"Continúa"},"859":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","content":"El inventario de certificados ofrece una vista global de las identidades emitidas por todas las autoridades. También puedes abrir **Issued Certificates** dentro de una CA para limitar la vista a ese emisor."},"860":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Abre **Certificates** y filtra por:"},"861":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"`Common Name` del sujeto."},"862":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Número de serie."},"863":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Estado."},"864":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Autoridad emisora."},"865":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Utiliza **Quick Inspect** para una comprobación rápida o **View Details** para ver el sujeto, SANs, usos, cadena, periodo de validez y metadatos completos."},"866":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"La acción de descarga entrega el certificado en formato PEM. Si el certificado se emitió mediante un CSR externo, la clave privada permanece en el sistema que generó ese CSR. Si se generó en el navegador, la clave solo estuvo disponible al finalizar la emisión."},"867":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca una identidad cuando la clave se haya comprometido, el sujeto ya no esté autorizado o el certificado deba dejar de aceptarse antes de expirar."},"868":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"En el inventario o la vista de detalle, selecciona **Revoke Certificate**."},"869":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Selecciona la razón que represente el incidente. Esta información se publica en OCSP y en la CRL."},"870":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma la operación y comprueba que el estado sea **Revoked**. Si la CA regenera la CRL al revocar, verifica también que exista una versión nueva."},"871":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Una revocación con la razón `CertificateHold` puede reactivarse. Las demás razones producen una revocación definitiva."},"872":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Validar con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta el estado de un certificado en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"873":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Distribuir una CRL\" description=\"Publica el estado para validación offline.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"874":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"page","content":"Arquitectura de la plataforma","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture"},"875":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","content":"Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos."},"876":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"Plano de control"},"877":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"Custodia y operaciones criptográficas"},"878":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"Emisión y enrolamiento"},"879":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Estado y validación"},"880":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"Dependencias de la plataforma"},"881":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","content":"Lamassu se despliega como un conjunto de servicios independientes. La separación evita que todos los componentes necesiten acceso directo a las claves privadas y permite escalar cada capacidad según la carga."},"882":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","content":"Cambia al nivel bajo para ver el interior de la caja de la plataforma Lamassu (CA, KMS, DMS, Device Manager, VA, Alerts, el conector de AWS IoT, Job Manager y la consola/API), y al nivel medio para verla como una única plataforma junto a sus dependencias externas."},"883":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"La consola y las APIs administran autoridades, certificados, DMS, dispositivos, alertas y configuración. Los eventos de dominio permiten que conectores y automatizaciones reaccionen a los cambios sin sondear continuamente la plataforma."},"884":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"El KMS ofrece una interfaz común sobre motores software, PKCS#11 y proveedores cloud. El motor seleccionado conserva la clave o delega la operación criptográfica sin que los demás servicios conozcan su implementación."},"885":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"El servicio de CA emite certificados y mantiene la relación con su autoridad. El DMS aplica las reglas de enrolamiento y expone los flujos EST para que un dispositivo solicite o renueve una identidad."},"886":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Device Manager conserva la vista operativa del dispositivo y su historial. Validation Authority publica OCSP y CRLs para que otros sistemas decidan si deben confiar en un certificado presentado."},"887":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"En un despliegue autogestionado, Lamassu utiliza PostgreSQL para persistencia, RabbitMQ para mensajería y un proveedor OIDC para autenticación. Consulta la arquitectura de despliegue para ver cómo se publican los servicios en Kubernetes."},"888":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"page","content":"Ciclo de vida de un certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle"},"889":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","content":"Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu."},"890":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#el-recorrido-completo","content":"El recorrido completo"},"891":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#solicitud","content":"Solicitud"},"892":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#emisión","content":"Emisión"},"893":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#uso-y-supervisión","content":"Uso y supervisión"},"894":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-o-re-enrolamiento","content":"Renovación o re-enrolamiento"},"895":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#revocación-o-retirada","content":"Revocación o retirada"},"896":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"Estados del certificado"},"897":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"Renovación y revocación no son equivalentes"},"898":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Efecto de revocar una CA"},"899":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Qué debes observar"},"900":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","content":"Emitir un certificado es solo el comienzo. Durante su vida útil debes comprobar su vigencia, renovarlo antes de que caduque y retirarlo cuando deje de ser fiable. Lamassu conserva el certificado, su CA emisora, su estado y, cuando pertenece a un dispositivo, la identidad a la que está vinculado."},"901":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#solicitud","content":"El solicitante genera una clave y una CSR. En los flujos recomendados, la clave privada permanece en el dispositivo, navegador o motor criptográfico que la creó."},"902":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#emisión","content":"La CA firma la CSR. El perfil de emisión determina la validez, los usos, el sujeto, las extensiones admitidas y las restricciones criptográficas."},"903":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#uso-y-supervisión","content":"El certificado queda en estado `ACTIVE`. Lamassu monitoriza su fecha `Not After`; el trabajo de monitorización criptográfica marca como `EXPIRED` los certificados que han vencido."},"904":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-o-re-enrolamiento","content":"Se emite un certificado nuevo antes de que caduque el anterior. En un DMS puedes abrir ventanas preventiva y crítica para que el dispositivo se re-enrole mediante EST."},"905":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#revocación-o-retirada","content":"Si la identidad deja de ser fiable, Lamassu registra la razón y la hora de revocación. OCSP y las CRLs permiten que los consumidores conozcan ese estado."},"906":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"Lamassu persiste cuatro estados X.509:"},"907":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"**`ACTIVE`**: el certificado está habilitado y dentro de su periodo de validez."},"908":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"**`EXPIRED`**: ha superado su fecha de expiración. El monitor lo detecta de forma periódica; no es un estado que deba asignarse manualmente."},"909":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"**`REVOKED`**: fue invalidado antes de expirar, con una razón y una marca temporal."},"910":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"**`INACTIVE`**: está deshabilitado sin representar una revocación definitiva."},"911":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-del-certificado","content":"La vista del dispositivo puede añadir estados operativos como ausencia de identidad, renovación pendiente, expiración próxima o baja. Son una interpretación del estado del dispositivo y de sus certificados, no nuevos estados X.509."},"912":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"La **renovación** crea un certificado sucesor para una identidad que continúa siendo válida. La **revocación** comunica que el certificado actual ya no debe aceptarse. Renueva para mantener continuidad; revoca ante compromiso, retirada o un cambio que invalide la identidad."},"913":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"Solo una revocación con razón `CertificateHold` puede revertirse. Una revocación con cualquier otra razón es definitiva en Lamassu."},"914":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"La operación **Reissue CA** genera otro certificado para la misma clave y enlaza ambos números de serie mediante metadatos. No equivale a una rotación de clave. Para cambiar la clave, crea una CA sucesora y realiza una migración con periodo de solapamiento."},"915":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Revocar una CA es una operación en cascada. Lamassu revoca sus CAs hijas y los certificados que ha emitido con la razón `CessationOfOperation`. La propagación continúa por la jerarquía."},"916":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Antes de confirmar:"},"917":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Identifica DMS, dispositivos y servicios que confían en esa cadena."},"918":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Distribuye la nueva cadena de confianza."},"919":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Reemite las identidades necesarias."},"920":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Comprueba OCSP y CRL desde un consumidor real."},"921":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Revoca la CA antigua cuando ya no exista tráfico legítimo."},"922":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#efecto-de-revocar-una-ca","content":"Dar de baja un dispositivo revoca sus certificados y le impide obtener nuevas identidades. Utiliza esta acción únicamente cuando el dispositivo se retire de forma permanente."},"923":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Certificados que entran en la ventana preventiva o crítica de renovación."},"924":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Errores repetidos de enrolamiento o re-enrolamiento."},"925":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Cambios de estado y razones de revocación."},"926":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Publicación y vigencia de OCSP y CRLs."},"927":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"Dependencias que todavía presentan un certificado sustituido."},"928":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#qué-debes-observar","content":"El historial del dispositivo relaciona sus identidades anteriores y actuales. Para cambios administrativos y errores de mutación, consulta Registros de auditoría."},"929":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","type":"page","content":"Glosario","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary"},"930":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","content":"Términos de PKI, certificados y gestión de identidades usados en Lamassu."},"931":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"A–C"},"932":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"D–K"},"933":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"M–R"},"934":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"S–Z"},"935":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**AKI (Authority Key Identifier)**\\\nIdentificador de la clave pública de la autoridad que firmó un certificado. Ayuda a construir la cadena hacia el emisor correcto."},"936":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**Ancla de confianza**\\\nCertificado, normalmente de una CA raíz, que un consumidor acepta de forma explícita como punto final de una cadena."},"937":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**CA (Certification Authority)**\\\nAutoridad que firma certificados y vincula una identidad con una clave pública."},"938":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**CA intermedia**\\\nCA firmada por otra autoridad. Se utiliza para emitir sin exponer la raíz a la operación diaria."},"939":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**CA raíz**\\\nCA autofirmada que inicia una jerarquía de confianza."},"940":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**Certificado X.509**\\\nDocumento firmado que contiene una clave pública, un sujeto, un emisor, un periodo de validez y extensiones que delimitan su uso."},"941":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**CRL (Certificate Revocation List)**\\\nLista firmada de certificados revocados publicada por una CA."},"942":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#ac","content":"**CSR (Certificate Signing Request)**\\\nSolicitud PKCS#10 que contiene una clave pública y atributos solicitados. La firma de la CSR demuestra posesión de la clave privada correspondiente."},"943":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**DMS (Device Management Service)**\\\nConfiguración que agrupa reglas de registro, enrolamiento, re-enrolamiento, emisión y distribución de CAs para una flota."},"944":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**Distinguished Name (DN)**\\\nConjunto de atributos del sujeto o emisor, como `CN`, `O`, `OU`, `C`, `ST` y `L`."},"945":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**EST (Enrollment over Secure Transport)**\\\nProtocolo definido en RFC 7030 para obtener CAs, enrolar y re-enrolar certificados sobre HTTPS."},"946":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**Extended Key Usage (EKU)**\\\nExtensión que acota finalidades como autenticación de cliente, autenticación de servidor, firma de código u OCSP."},"947":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**Identidad de dispositivo**\\\nRelación entre un dispositivo y uno de sus certificados. Un dispositivo puede conservar un historial de identidades."},"948":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**Identity slot**\\\nPosición lógica en un dispositivo donde Lamassu vincula una identidad activa o histórica."},"949":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**JITP (Just-in-Time Provisioning)**\\\nRegistro automático de un dispositivo cuando completa correctamente su primer enrolamiento."},"950":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**KMS (Key Management Service)**\\\nServicio de Lamassu que normaliza generación, importación y uso de claves sobre distintos motores criptográficos."},"951":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#dk","content":"**Key Usage**\\\nExtensión X.509 que permite operaciones básicas como firma digital, cifrado de clave o firma de certificados."},"952":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**mTLS (Mutual TLS)**\\\nTLS donde cliente y servidor presentan certificados. Un DMS puede usar el certificado cliente como método de autenticación."},"953":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**OCSP (Online Certificate Status Protocol)**\\\nProtocolo para consultar en línea si un certificado está vigente, revocado o es desconocido."},"954":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**Perfil de emisión**\\\nPolítica reutilizable que define cómo Lamassu construye un certificado y qué claves acepta."},"955":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**Principal**\\\nIdentidad de operador o cliente de API reconocida por el servicio de autorización. Lamassu admite principales OIDC y X.509."},"956":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**Política**\\\nConjunto de permisos asignable a uno o varios principales."},"957":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**RA (Registration Authority)**\\\nComponente que verifica al solicitante antes de pedir a una CA que emita. El DMS cumple este papel en los flujos de enrolamiento de dispositivos."},"958":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**Relying party**\\\nSistema consumidor que decide si acepta un certificado presentado."},"959":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#mr","content":"**Revocación**\\\nInvalidación de un certificado antes de su fecha de expiración."},"960":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"**SAN (Subject Alternative Name)**\\\nExtensión que añade identidades como nombres DNS, direcciones IP, correos o URIs."},"961":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"**SKI (Subject Key Identifier)**\\\nIdentificador derivado de la clave pública del propio certificado."},"962":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"**VA (Validation Authority)**\\\nServicio de Lamassu responsable de las respuestas OCSP y la generación o publicación de CRLs."},"963":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"**Ventana de renovación**\\\nPeriodo anterior a la expiración durante el que un dispositivo puede o debe solicitar otra identidad."},"964":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/glossary#sz","content":"¿Falta un término operativo? Consulta primero Cómo funciona Lamassu y el Modelo de confianza, donde estos conceptos aparecen conectados."},"965":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"page","content":"Cómo funciona Lamassu","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview"},"966":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","content":"El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos."},"967":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"El modelo en cinco piezas"},"968":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Del alta a la operación"},"969":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","content":"Lamassu conecta tres elementos: una **raíz de confianza**, una **política de emisión** y una **entidad que necesita demostrar su identidad**. La plataforma coordina esos elementos durante todo el ciclo de vida del certificado."},"970":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Motor criptográfico.** Genera o custodia claves y ejecuta las operaciones privadas sin exponer el material criptográfico al resto de servicios."},"971":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Autoridad de certificación (CA).** Firma certificados y establece la cadena de confianza."},"972":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Device Management Service (DMS).** Define cómo se registran, autentican y renuevan los dispositivos de una flota."},"973":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Dispositivo.** Conserva su clave privada y presenta el certificado para demostrar su identidad."},"974":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Validation Authority (VA).** Publica el estado de los certificados mediante OCSP y CRL."},"975":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un administrador configura un motor criptográfico y crea o importa una CA."},"976":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un DMS relaciona esa CA con una política de enrolamiento."},"977":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"El dispositivo genera una clave y solicita un certificado mediante EST, o un operador le asigna una identidad."},"978":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Lamassu conserva el inventario, el historial y el estado de la identidad."},"979":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Los consumidores comprueban la cadena y consultan OCSP o una CRL cuando necesitan conocer su vigencia."},"980":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Arquitectura\" description=\"Conoce los componentes y dónde termina la responsabilidad de cada uno.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture\" />"},"981":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Ciclo de vida de una identidad\" description=\"Sigue un certificado desde el enrolamiento hasta la renovación o revocación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle\" />"},"982":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"page","content":"Modelo de confianza","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model"},"983":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","content":"Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente."},"984":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#las-cuatro-decisiones-de-confianza","content":"Las cuatro decisiones de confianza"},"985":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-puede-emitir","content":"Quién puede emitir"},"986":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#qué-puede-emitirse","content":"Qué puede emitirse"},"987":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-puede-solicitarlo","content":"Quién puede solicitarlo"},"988":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-acepta-el-resultado","content":"Quién acepta el resultado"},"989":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"Flujo de una identidad"},"990":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"CAs de enrolamiento, validación y distribución"},"991":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"Validación y revocación"},"992":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#límites-de-custodia","content":"Límites de custodia"},"993":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Patrón recomendado"},"994":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","content":"En Lamassu, confianza no significa simplemente que un certificado exista en el inventario. Un consumidor confía en una identidad cuando puede construir una cadena hasta una raíz que reconoce, comprobar que el certificado sirve para el uso esperado y verificar que sigue vigente."},"995":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-puede-emitir","content":"La jerarquía de CAs define qué autoridades pueden firmar. Una CA raíz establece el ancla de confianza; las CAs intermedias separan ámbitos operativos y evitan utilizar la raíz para cada emisión."},"996":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#qué-puede-emitirse","content":"Los perfiles de certificado limitan validez, sujeto, usos, extensiones y parámetros criptográficos. La posesión de una CA no sustituye a una política de emisión."},"997":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-puede-solicitarlo","content":"El DMS actúa como punto de enrolamiento. Puede autenticar una solicitud EST con certificado cliente, webhook externo o una combinación de ambos. Las CAs configuradas para validar al solicitante no tienen por qué ser la CA que emitirá la identidad nueva."},"998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#quién-acepta-el-resultado","content":"El servicio o dispositivo consumidor mantiene su propio almacén de confianza. Lamassu puede distribuir la CA del sistema, la CA de enrolamiento y otras CAs gestionadas mediante `/cacerts`, pero el consumidor decide cuáles instala y cómo aplica la validación."},"999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"El dispositivo demuestra que puede enrolarse según la política del DMS."},"1000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"El DMS valida la solicitud y remite la CSR a la CA de enrolamiento."},"1001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"La CA aplica el perfil y firma sin recibir la clave privada del dispositivo."},"1002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"El dispositivo instala el certificado y la cadena que necesita."},"1003":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"El sistema que confía en el dispositivo valida cadena, fechas, usos y estado de revocación."},"1004":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#flujo-de-una-identidad","content":"OIDC o X.509 identifica al operador que llama a Lamassu. El servicio de autorización decide qué acciones puede realizar. La jerarquía X.509, en cambio, determina si un certificado presentado por un dispositivo es confiable."},"1005":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"Un DMS relaciona tres conjuntos que conviene diseñar por separado:"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"**CA de enrolamiento:** firma las nuevas identidades."},"1007":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"**CAs de validación:** autentican certificados cliente usados para enrolamiento o migración. En re-enrolamiento, Lamassu prueba primero la CA de enrolamiento y después las CAs de validación adicionales."},"1008":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"**CAs distribuidas:** forman el contenido que el dispositivo obtiene mediante EST `/cacerts`. Puedes incluir la CA del sistema, la CA de enrolamiento y una lista de CAs gestionadas."},"1009":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#cas-de-enrolamiento-validación-y-distribución","content":"Esta separación permite migrar una flota: aceptas temporalmente certificados de la jerarquía anterior, emites con la nueva y distribuyes ambas cadenas durante el solapamiento."},"1010":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"Una cadena válida no garantiza por sí sola que el certificado deba aceptarse. El consumidor también debe comprobar:"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"que la fecha actual está entre `Not Before` y `Not After`;"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"que `Key Usage` y `Extended Key Usage` permiten la operación;"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"que nombres, SANs y sujeto coinciden con la identidad esperada;"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"que el certificado no aparece revocado mediante OCSP o una CRL."},"1015":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#validación-y-revocación","content":"Durante la autenticación mTLS de un DMS, Lamassu intenta comprobar la revocación. Si el certificado no contiene información suficiente para efectuar esa comprobación, el backend registra una advertencia y continúa tratándolo como no revocado. Diseña los perfiles y puntos de distribución para evitar esa situación en producción."},"1016":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#límites-de-custodia","content":"El KMS conserva la referencia de la clave y delega la operación al motor configurado. Con un HSM o un KMS cloud, la clave privada puede permanecer no exportable. Eso protege la custodia, pero no impide por sí solo el uso indebido: todavía debes restringir quién puede ordenar una firma y auditar esas operaciones."},"1017":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Mantén la raíz fuera de las operaciones diarias o con acceso muy restringido."},"1018":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Emite desde CAs intermedias separadas por entorno o dominio de riesgo."},"1019":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Asigna perfiles explícitos a cada caso de uso."},"1020":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Distribuye la nueva confianza antes de comenzar una rotación."},"1021":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Mantén solapamiento suficiente para renovar una flota desconectada."},"1022":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Valida desde el sistema consumidor, no solo desde la consola de Lamassu."},"1023":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model#patrón-recomendado","content":"Continúa con Jerarquía y rotación de CAs para convertir este modelo en un procedimiento operativo."},"1024":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"page","content":"Listas de revocación (CRL)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","content":"Genera y distribuye listas firmadas para validar certificados sin conexión."},"1026":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Servicio CRL"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Rol VA y configuración por CA"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Regeneración periódica y automática"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"Contenido de la CRL"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"Endpoint público de descarga"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"API de gestión del rol VA"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#desde-la-interfaz","content":"Desde la interfaz"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#referencias","content":"Referencias"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Una CRL (*Certificate Revocation List*) es una lista firmada que contiene los números de serie de los certificados revocados antes de su fecha de caducidad. A diferencia de OCSP, no requiere una consulta en tiempo real: la parte que confía descarga la lista periódicamente y la consulta de forma local."},"1035":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Lamassu genera y mantiene una CRL por cada CA que gestiona. Cada CRL está firmada con la clave privada de la propia CA emisora y se almacena en el sistema de almacenamiento de objetos configurado en la plataforma."},"1036":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"La publicación de la CRL de cada CA se controla mediante un *rol VA*. Este objeto define cómo se genera, cuándo se regenera y qué clave se utiliza para firmarla."},"1037":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Los parámetros principales son:"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`validity`** define el periodo de validez reflejado en `nextUpdate`. Su valor predeterminado es 7 días."},"1039":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`refresh_interval`** establece el intervalo mínimo entre regeneraciones programadas. Por defecto es aproximadamente 6 días y 23 horas."},"1040":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`regenerate_on_revoke`** ordena publicar una versión nueva inmediatamente después de una revocación. Está activo por defecto."},"1041":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"El campo `subject_key_id_signer` identifica la CA cuya clave privada firma la CRL. Por defecto, cada CA firma su propia CRL."},"1042":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Cada CRL lleva un número de versión incremental. Lamassu almacena todas las versiones en la ruta `pki/va/crl/{subject_key_id}/{version}.crl` del almacenamiento de objetos."},"1043":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Un proceso en segundo plano supervisa los roles VA activos. Cuando la validez restante de la CRL vigente cae por debajo del período de vigilancia configurado (*blind period*), el sistema solicita la generación de una nueva CRL. Así se evita que la CRL publicada caduque sin que exista una versión válida disponible."},"1044":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Además, cuando `regenerate_on_revoke` está activo, que es el comportamiento por defecto, cualquier revocación de un certificado desencadena inmediatamente la generación de una nueva CRL para la CA afectada. Esto reduce al mínimo el tiempo entre la revocación y su publicación."},"1045":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"Cada entrada de la CRL incluye el número de serie del certificado revocado, la fecha de revocación y el código de razón conforme a RFC 5280."},"1046":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"La CRL incluye también la extensión *Issuing Distribution Point* (IDP, OID 2.5.29.28), marcada como crítica, que indica la URL pública desde la que puede descargarse. Esa URL apunta al endpoint `/crl/{subject_key_id}` de cada dominio VA configurado."},"1047":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"La CRL más reciente de una CA se puede obtener directamente sin autenticación:"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"La respuesta tiene `Content-Type: application/pkix-crl` y contiene la CRL en formato DER."},"1049":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"El rol VA de una CA se puede consultar y actualizar mediante la API:"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Método"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Ruta"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Descripción"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`GET`"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`/v1/roles/{ca-ski}`"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Devuelve la configuración del rol VA y los metadatos de la última CRL emitida."},"1056":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`PUT`"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`/v1/roles/{ca-ski}`"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Actualiza los parámetros de la configuración del rol VA (`validity`, `refresh_interval`, `regenerate_on_revoke`)."},"1059":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Ejemplo de consulta del rol VA:"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"La respuesta incluye el campo `latest_crl` con la versión, la fecha de inicio de validez y la fecha de caducidad 