 causa."},"1381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-239","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"La implementación de Lamassu se ajusta al RFC 7030 en lo esencial pero introduce varias particularidades que pueden afectar a clientes EST estrictos o a librerías de terceros:"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-240","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Los endpoints `/csrattrs` y `/fullcmc` del RFC 7030 **no están implementados** en Lamassu. Un cliente que invoque `/.well-known/est/<DMS_ID>/csrattrs` recibirá `404 Not Found` en lugar del `204 No Content` que el RFC sugiere para \"sin atributos\". Las librerías EST estrictas deben configurarse para no intentar `csrattrs`."},"1383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-241","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El base64 de la respuesta de `/cacerts` y `/simpleenroll` se trocea en líneas de **76 caracteres** terminadas con CRLF (conforme con S/MIME, RFC 5751). Las partes de `/serverkeygen` no aplican wrap."},"1384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-242","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El boundary del `multipart/mixed` en `/serverkeygen` está fijado y no se puede negociar."},"1385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-243","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El segmento `{aps}` es **obligatorio** en todas las rutas EST. Las rutas registradas sin `{aps}` están en el código pero responden `400`."},"1386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-244","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El cuerpo de `/cacerts`, `/simpleenroll` y `/simplereenroll` puede devolverse como PEM concatenado si el cliente envía `Accept: application/x-pem-file`. Esta es una extensión específica de Lamassu y no aparece en el RFC."},"1387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-245","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El servidor no rechaza explícitamente CSRs firmados con SHA-1 o MD5; el integrador debe generar el CSR con SHA-256 o superior."},"1388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-246","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Visión general del DMS\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-247","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Validación OCSP\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-248","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Gestionar dispositivos\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-management\" />"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Integraciones"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos."},"1393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Arquitectura del conector"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Prerrequisitos"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Permisos IAM necesarios"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform