ions/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Gestionar grupos de Things"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"`iot:CreateProvisioningTemplate`"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Crear plantillas JITP"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"`iotdata:GetThingShadow` / `iotdata:UpdateThingShadow`"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Leer y escribir el Device Shadow"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Para el mecanismo de desconexión forzada tras revocación también se requiere acceso a la API del plano de datos de AWS IoT (`iot:Connect` con SigV4 sobre WebSocket), que se negocia de forma implícita con las c