iles\" />"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"<Card title=\"Jerarquía y rotación\" description=\"Sustituye certificados o claves de CA sin romper la confianza.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation\" />"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"<Card title=\"Control de acceso\" description=\"Configura principales, políticas y el primer administrador.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/access-control\" />"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"<Card title=\"Resolución de problemas\" description=\"Diagnostica Gateway, servicios, emisión y enrolamiento.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting\" />"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"page","content":"Crea tu primera CA","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"Crea una autoridad raíz y comprueba que está preparada para emitir certificados."},"