/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre que identifique el propósito de la CA, por ejemplo `Acme Device Root CA`."},"1768":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz se autofirma y actúa como ancla de confianza. Para producción suele ser preferible mantener la raíz más protegida y emitir desde una CA intermedia."},"1769":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"En el menú lateral, abre **Certification Authorities** y selecciona **Create New CA**."},"1770":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"Elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo. Si ya tienes la clave en el KMS, usa &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)**."},"1771":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Elige el motor criptográfico que custodiará la clave y configura el algoritmo. Para una primera CA pue