roubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"1854":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"1855":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"1856":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"1857":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"1858":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform